            "conclusion": "`g2 t` is $g_2(t)$: the sum over $r_1,r_2\\le\\lfloor t\\rfloor$, coprime with $r_1r_2$ odd, of $\\mu(r_1)\\mu(r_2)/(\\sigma(r_1)\\sigma(r_2))$; this is $g_v$ for $v=2$ only."
